   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">The size of the directory does not necessarily correspond to the memory requirements of your application.<div>Have you tried using a larger instance size with more memory?</div><div><br></div><div>FWIW, each instance will have the same memory requirements, as each one would be loading your data set and performing computations.</div></div>"
    ],
    [
